{
"#name"
:
{
"fskv"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"基于目录共享的简易键值存储"
,
"en"
:
"Lightweight shared key-value store backed by a directory"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
"x fskv :<root> <op> <args>..."
,
"x fskv -r|--root <path> <op> <args>..."
,
"x fskv root [path]"
,
"x fskv put <key> <value>"
,
"x fskv get <key>"
,
"x fskv has <key>"
,
"x fskv ls <prefix>"
,
"x fskv rm <key>"
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"基于目录共享的简易键值存储：每个 key 就是同名文件，默认根目录是当前目录下的 `.x-cmd/fskv`，任何对该目录有读写权限的进程或用户都能共享同一份状态。"
,
"en"
:
"A lightweight shared key-value store backed by a directory — each key is just a same-named file, with `./.x-cmd/fskv` as the default root so any process or user with read/write access can share state through it."
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"未显式设置 root 时，所有子命令默认作用于 `./.x-cmd/fskv`（自动创建），单文件即可上手。"
,
"en"
:
"When no root is set, every subcommand targets `./.x-cmd/fskv` under the current directory (auto-created) — zero-config, ready in one command."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"根目录就是普通的文件系统目录，把它放到 NFS / git worktree / 共享挂载点上，就能让多台机器或多用户共享同一份键值。"
,
"en"
:
"The root is just a plain filesystem directory; put it on NFS, a git worktree, or any shared mount to let multiple machines or users share the same key-value space."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"key 中的 `/` 被解释为目录层级；连续多个 `/` 会自动合并为单个 `/`（例如 `abc//cde//ef` 等价于 `abc/cde/ef`）；当一个文件与即将创建的目录同名，模块会自动把它迁移到目录内的默认值文件。"
,
"en"
:
"`/` in a key is interpreted as directory hierarchy; consecutive `/` are collapsed into a single `/` (so `abc//cde//ef` is equivalent to `abc/cde/ef`); if a file shares a name with a directory-to-be-created, it is migrated into that directory as the default-value file."
}
,
{
"cn"
:
"用 `x fskv :<root> <op> ...` 或 `-r|--root <path>` 可以在不改动会话状态的前提下，临时把操作切到任意根目录。"
,
"en"
:
"Use `x fskv :<root> <op> ...` or `-r|--root <path>` to target an arbitrary root without mutating the session state."
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv put greeting \"hello\""
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 在默认根目录 ./x-cmd/fskv 下写入 greeting=hello"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Write greeting=hello under the default root ./.x-cmd/fskv"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv get greeting"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 读取默认根目录下 key=greeting 的值"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Read value of greeting from the default root"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv root ~/shared/fskv"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 把当前 shell 的存储根目录改为 ~/shared/fskv（适合多用户/多进程共享）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Switch this shell's root to ~/shared/fskv (ideal for multi-user / multi-process sharing)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv -r /tmp/fskv-demo put msg hello"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 用 -r 标志在 /tmp/fskv-demo 下写入 msg=hello，不改会话状态"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Use -r flag to write msg=hello under /tmp/fskv-demo without changing session state"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv :/tmp/fskv-demo put msg hello"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 用 : 前缀一次性切到 /tmp/fskv-demo 后再执行 put"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Use : prefix to one-shot switch to /tmp/fskv-demo before put"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv ls user"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 列出 user 命名空间下的所有 key"
,
"en"
:
"Example: List all keys under the user namespace"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv has user/name"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 判断 key=user/name 是否存在"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Check whether key user/name exists"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x fskv rm user/name"
,
"cn"
:
"示例: 删除 key=user/name（目录 key 只删其默认值文件，子 key 保留）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Delete key user/name (a dir key removes only its default-value file; child keys stay)"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:配置"
:
[
"root"
]
,
"#subcmd:读写"
:
[
"put"
,
"get"
,
"rm"
]
,
"#subcmd:查询"
:
[
"has"
,
"ls"
]
,
"root"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示或设置当前 shell 会话的存储根目录（省略参数则打印当前值）"
,
"en"
:
"Show or set the storage root for the current shell session (omit to print current value)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"存储根目录路径"
,
"en"
:
"Storage root path"
}
}
}
,
"put"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"写入一个键值对，key 中可用 / 分层；未指定 root 时默认写入 ./x-cmd/fskv"
,
"en"
:
"Write a key/value pair; `/` creates a hierarchy; defaults to ./.x-cmd/fskv when no root is set"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"键名（支持 / 分层）"
,
"en"
:
"Key name (may contain `/` for hierarchy)"
}
}
,
"#2"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"要写入的值"
,
"en"
:
"Value to write"
}
}
}
,
"get"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"读取指定 key 的值，key 不存在时返回非零退出码；默认根目录 ./x-cmd/fskv"
,
"en"
:
"Read the value of a key; returns non-zero if missing; defaults to ./.x-cmd/fskv"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"键名"
,
"en"
:
"Key name"
}
}
}
,
"has"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"判断 key 是否存在（文件或默认值文件）；默认根目录 ./x-cmd/fskv"
,
"en"
:
"Check whether a key exists (as a file or default-value file); defaults to ./.x-cmd/fskv"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"键名"
,
"en"
:
"Key name"
}
}
}
,
"ls"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"列出指定前缀下的所有 key；默认根目录 ./x-cmd/fskv"
,
"en"
:
"List all keys under the given prefix; defaults to ./.x-cmd/fskv"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"key 前缀（必填）"
,
"en"
:
"Key prefix (required)"
}
}
}
,
"rm"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"删除一个 key；若 key 是目录，只删除其默认值文件，子 key 不受影响"
,
"en"
:
"Delete a key; for a dir key, removes only its default-value file, leaving child keys intact"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"键名"
,
"en"
:
"Key name"
}
}
}
,
